{"title":"python语法进阶（一）","date":"2024-05-10T14:21:10.000Z","date_formatted":{"ll":"2024年5月10日","L":"2024/05/10","MM-DD":"05-10"},"thumbnail":"images/2024/05/10/pose.jpg","link":"2024/05/10/python语法进阶（一）","comments":true,"tags":["python"],"categories":["python"],"updated":"2025-12-13T14:45:59.514Z","content":"<p>本文基本介绍下在python中常用的装饰器、多线程、迭代器/生成器、以及协程（Asyncio）。</p>\n<span id=\"more\"></span>\n<h2 id=\"一、装饰器-(decorators)\">一、装饰器 (Decorators)<a title=\"#一、装饰器-(decorators)\" href=\"#一、装饰器-(decorators)\"></a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"1.-基本概念\">1. 基本概念<a title=\"#1.-基本概念\" href=\"#1.-基本概念\"></a></h3>\n<p>装饰器本质上是一个 Python 函数（或类），它可以让其他函数在不需要做任何代码变动的前提下增加额外功能，装饰器的返回值也是一个函数对象。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>核心思想</strong>：开放封闭原则（对扩展开放，对修改封闭）。</li>\n<li><strong>语法糖</strong>：使用 <code>@</code> 符号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"2.-必备基础\">2. 必备基础<a title=\"#2.-必备基础\" href=\"#2.-必备基础\"></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>函数即变量</strong>：函数名指向内存地址，可以赋值、作为参数传递。</li>\n<li><strong>高阶函数</strong>：接收函数作为参数，或返回一个函数。</li>\n<li><strong>嵌套函数</strong>：在函数内部定义函数。</li>\n<li><strong>闭包</strong>：内层函数引用了外层函数的非全局变量（自由变量），并被返回。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"3.-标准装饰器模板\">3. 标准装饰器模板<a title=\"#3.-标准装饰器模板\" href=\"#3.-标准装饰器模板\"></a></h3>\n<p><strong>优化点</strong>：引入 <code>functools.wraps</code>，防止被装饰函数的元信息（如 <code>__name__</code>, <code>__doc__</code>）丢失。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> time</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> functools <span class=\"keyword\">import</span> wraps  <span class=\"comment\"># 标准库工具</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">timer_decorator</span>(<span class=\"params\">func</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"string\">&quot;&quot;&quot;计算函数运行时间的装饰器&quot;&quot;&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta\">    @wraps(<span class=\"params\">func</span>)  </span><span class=\"comment\"># 关键：保留原函数的元信息（函数名、注释等）</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">wrapper</span>(<span class=\"params\">*args, **kwargs</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        start_time = time.time()</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;开始执行函数: <span class=\"subst\">&#123;func.__name__&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        </span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"comment\"># 执行原函数</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        result = func(*args, **kwargs)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        </span><br><span class=\"line\">        end_time = time.time()</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;执行结束，耗时: <span class=\"subst\">&#123;end_time - start_time:<span class=\"number\">.4</span>f&#125;</span> 秒&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> result</span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> wrapper</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta\">@timer_decorator</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">heavy_process</span>(<span class=\"params\">name, delay</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"string\">&quot;&quot;&quot;这是一个模拟耗时操作的函数&quot;&quot;&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    time.sleep(delay)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;<span class=\"subst\">&#123;name&#125;</span> 处理完成&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"string\">&quot;Success&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 调用</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;当前函数名: <span class=\"subst\">&#123;heavy_process.__name__&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)  <span class=\"comment\"># 如果没有@wraps，这里会显示 wrapper</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">heavy_process(<span class=\"string\">&quot;数据处理&quot;</span>, <span class=\"number\">1</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h3 id=\"4.-带参数的装饰器\">4. 带参数的装饰器<a title=\"#4.-带参数的装饰器\" href=\"#4.-带参数的装饰器\"></a></h3>\n<p>当装饰器本身需要传递参数时，需要再包裹一层函数。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">log_level</span>(<span class=\"params\">level=<span class=\"string\">&quot;INFO&quot;</span></span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">decorator</span>(<span class=\"params\">func</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta\">        @wraps(<span class=\"params\">func</span>)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">wrapper</span>(<span class=\"params\">*args, **kwargs</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;[<span class=\"subst\">&#123;level&#125;</span>] 正在调用 <span class=\"subst\">&#123;func.__name__&#125;</span>...&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> func(*args, **kwargs)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> wrapper</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> decorator</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta\">@log_level(<span class=\"params\">level=<span class=\"string\">&quot;DEBUG&quot;</span></span>)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">test_func</span>():</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">pass</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">test_func()</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"二、多线程高级运用-(threading)\">二、多线程高级运用 (Threading)<a title=\"#二、多线程高级运用-(threading)\" href=\"#二、多线程高级运用-(threading)\"></a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"1.-event-对象-(线程通信)\">1. Event 对象 (线程通信)<a title=\"#1.-event-对象-(线程通信)\" href=\"#1.-event-对象-(线程通信)\"></a></h3>\n<p>用于线程间的信号同步。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>event.wait()</code>: 阻塞线程，直到标志位被设为 True。</li>\n<li><code>event.set()</code>: 将标志位设为 True，唤醒等待的线程。</li>\n<li><code>event.clear()</code>: 将标志位重置为 False。</li>\n</ul>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> threading</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> time</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"title class_\">MyThread</span>(threading.Thread):</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">__init__</span>(<span class=\"params\">self, event</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"built_in\">super</span>().__init__()</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"variable language_\">self</span>.event = event</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">run</span>(<span class=\"params\">self</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;线程<span class=\"subst\">&#123;self.name&#125;</span>已经初始化，随时准备呼叫何总……&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"comment\"># 设置线程等待</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"variable language_\">self</span>.event.wait()</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;<span class=\"subst\">&#123;self.name&#125;</span>开始执行……何总你好，🤭&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">if</span> __name__ == <span class=\"string\">&#x27;__main__&#x27;</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    event = threading.Event()</span><br><span class=\"line\">    threads = []</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 创建十个自定义对象</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    [threads.append(MyThread(event)) <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"number\">11</span>)]</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    event.clear()</span><br><span class=\"line\">    [t.start() <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> t <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> threads]</span><br><span class=\"line\">    time.sleep(<span class=\"number\">2</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    event.<span class=\"built_in\">set</span>()</span><br><span class=\"line\">    [t.join() <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> t <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> threads]</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">&quot;所有线程已执行完毕&quot;</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h3 id=\"2.-threading.local-(线程隔离)\">2. Threading.local (线程隔离)<a title=\"#2.-threading.local-(线程隔离)\" href=\"#2.-threading.local-(线程隔离)\"></a></h3>\n<p>解决多线程并发时，全局变量数据错乱的问题，为每个线程创建独立的数据副本。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> threading</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 创建全局的 local 对象</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">local_data = threading.local()</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">process_student</span>():</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 获取当前线程关联的 student 属性，不同线程互不干扰</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    thread_name = threading.current_thread().name</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&#x27;线程 <span class=\"subst\">&#123;thread_name&#125;</span> 处理学生: <span class=\"subst\">&#123;local_data.student&#125;</span>&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">process_thread</span>(<span class=\"params\">name</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 绑定 ThreadLocal 的 student 属性</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    local_data.student = name</span><br><span class=\"line\">    process_student()</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">t1 = threading.Thread(target=process_thread, args=(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;李白&#x27;</span>,), name=<span class=\"string\">&#x27;Thread-A&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">t2 = threading.Thread(target=process_thread, args=(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;杜甫&#x27;</span>,), name=<span class=\"string\">&#x27;Thread-B&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">t1.start()</span><br><span class=\"line\">t2.start()</span><br><span class=\"line\">t1.join()</span><br><span class=\"line\">t2.join()</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h3 id=\"3.-线程池-(threadpoolexecutor)\">3. 线程池 (ThreadPoolExecutor)<a title=\"#3.-线程池-(threadpoolexecutor)\" href=\"#3.-线程池-(threadpoolexecutor)\"></a></h3>\n<p><strong>优化点</strong>：推荐使用上下文管理器 <code>with</code> 语法，自动处理线程池的关闭。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> concurrent.futures <span class=\"keyword\">import</span> ThreadPoolExecutor, as_completed</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> time</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">task</span>(<span class=\"params\">n</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    time.sleep(n)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"string\">f&quot;任务 <span class=\"subst\">&#123;n&#125;</span> 完成&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 使用 with 自动管理资源</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">with</span> ThreadPoolExecutor(max_workers=<span class=\"number\">3</span>) <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> executor:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 方式1: submit (非阻塞，返回 Future 对象)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    future1 = executor.submit(task, <span class=\"number\">1</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    future2 = executor.submit(task, <span class=\"number\">2</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 获取结果（会阻塞直到完成）</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(future1.result())</span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 方式2: map (类似 Python 的 map，按顺序返回结果)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    results = executor.<span class=\"built_in\">map</span>(task, [<span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"number\">2</span>, <span class=\"number\">1</span>])</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> res <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> results:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(res)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">&quot;线程池已关闭&quot;</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"三、可迭代对象与迭代器\">三、可迭代对象与迭代器<a title=\"#三、可迭代对象与迭代器\" href=\"#三、可迭代对象与迭代器\"></a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"1.-核心区别\">1. 核心区别<a title=\"#1.-核心区别\" href=\"#1.-核心区别\"></a></h3>\n<div class=\"φbq\"><div class=\"φbs\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">概念</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">定义</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">核心方法</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">举例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>可迭代对象 (Iterable)</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">可以被 <code>for</code> 循环遍历的对象</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><code>__iter__</code> (或实现了 <code>__getitem__</code>)</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">list, str, tuple</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>迭代器 (Iterator)</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">可以记录遍历位置的对象</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><code>__iter__</code> <strong>和</strong> <code>__next__</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><code>iter(list)</code>, generator</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><h3 id=\"2.-生成器-(generator)\">2. 生成器 (Generator)<a title=\"#2.-生成器-(generator)\" href=\"#2.-生成器-(generator)\"></a></h3>\n<p>生成器是特殊的迭代器，写法更简洁，节省内存。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>yield</strong>: 暂停函数执行，返回数据，保留上下文。</li>\n<li><strong>send(value)</strong>: 恢复执行，并向生成器内部发送数据（<code>yield</code> 表达式的返回值）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>代码优化：yield from (子生成器)</strong><br>\nPython 3.3+ 引入，用于委托生成器。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">sub_gen</span>():</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">yield</span> <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">yield</span> <span class=\"number\">2</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">main_gen</span>():</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">yield</span> <span class=\"string\">&#x27;start&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">yield</span> <span class=\"keyword\">from</span> sub_gen()  <span class=\"comment\"># 自动遍历 sub_gen</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">yield</span> <span class=\"string\">&#x27;end&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> main_gen():</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(i) <span class=\"comment\"># 输出: start, 1, 2, end</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"四、asyncio-协程-(重点更新)\">四、Asyncio 协程 (重点更新)<a title=\"#四、asyncio-协程-(重点更新)\" href=\"#四、asyncio-协程-(重点更新)\"></a></h2>\n<p><strong>注意</strong>：Python 3.7+ 对 <code>asyncio</code> API 进行了大幅简化，<strong>尽量避免</strong>直接手动操作 <code>get_event_loop()</code>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"1.-核心概念\">1. 核心概念<a title=\"#1.-核心概念\" href=\"#1.-核心概念\"></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Event Loop</strong>: 程序的心脏，负责调度和执行任务。</li>\n<li><strong>Coroutine</strong>: <code>async def</code> 定义的函数。</li>\n<li><strong>Awaitable</strong>: 可以在 <code>await</code> 后面等待的对象（协程、Task、Future）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"2.-现代写法-(python-3.7+)\">2. 现代写法 (Python 3.7+)<a title=\"#2.-现代写法-(python-3.7+)\" href=\"#2.-现代写法-(python-3.7+)\"></a></h3>\n<p><strong>Hello World 示例：</strong></p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> asyncio</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> time</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">say_after</span>(<span class=\"params\">delay, what</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">await</span> asyncio.sleep(delay)  <span class=\"comment\"># 异步等待</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"string\">f&quot;<span class=\"subst\">&#123;what&#125;</span> (延迟 <span class=\"subst\">&#123;delay&#125;</span>s)&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">main</span>():</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;开始时间: <span class=\"subst\">&#123;time.strftime(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;%X&#x27;</span>)&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 创建任务 (并发执行的关键)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># create_task 会立即将协程加入事件循环调度</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    task1 = asyncio.create_task(say_after(<span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;Hello&#x27;</span>))</span><br><span class=\"line\">    task2 = asyncio.create_task(say_after(<span class=\"number\">2</span>, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;World&#x27;</span>))</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">&quot;任务已创建，正在后台运行...&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 等待任务完成</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    ret1 = <span class=\"keyword\">await</span> task1</span><br><span class=\"line\">    ret2 = <span class=\"keyword\">await</span> task2</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;结果: <span class=\"subst\">&#123;ret1&#125;</span>, <span class=\"subst\">&#123;ret2&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;结束时间: <span class=\"subst\">&#123;time.strftime(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;%X&#x27;</span>)&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">if</span> __name__ == <span class=\"string\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 程序的唯一入口，自动创建和关闭 loop</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    asyncio.run(main())</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h3 id=\"3.-并发神器：asyncio.gather\">3. 并发神器：asyncio.gather<a title=\"#3.-并发神器：asyncio.gather\" href=\"#3.-并发神器：asyncio.gather\"></a></h3>\n<p>替代旧版的 <code>wait</code>，更方便地收集结果。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> asyncio</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">worker</span>(<span class=\"params\">name, seconds</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;<span class=\"subst\">&#123;name&#125;</span> 开始工作&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">await</span> asyncio.sleep(seconds)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;<span class=\"subst\">&#123;name&#125;</span> 结束工作&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"string\">f&quot;<span class=\"subst\">&#123;name&#125;</span>的数据&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">main</span>():</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 同时运行多个协程，并收集所有结果</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    results = <span class=\"keyword\">await</span> asyncio.gather(</span><br><span class=\"line\">        worker(<span class=\"string\">&quot;A&quot;</span>, <span class=\"number\">2</span>),</span><br><span class=\"line\">        worker(<span class=\"string\">&quot;B&quot;</span>, <span class=\"number\">1</span>),</span><br><span class=\"line\">        worker(<span class=\"string\">&quot;C&quot;</span>, <span class=\"number\">3</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    )</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># results 是一个列表，顺序与传入 gather 的顺序一致</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;所有任务结果: <span class=\"subst\">&#123;results&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">if</span> __name__ == <span class=\"string\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    asyncio.run(main())</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h3 id=\"4.-同步-vs-异步-性能对比\">4. 同步 vs 异步 性能对比<a title=\"#4.-同步-vs-异步-性能对比\" href=\"#4.-同步-vs-异步-性能对比\"></a></h3>\n<p>异步 IO (<code>await asyncio.sleep</code>) 会释放 CPU 控制权，而同步阻塞 (<code>time.sleep</code>) 会卡死整个线程。在爬虫或 Web 服务中，异步能利用等待时间处理其他请求。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"五、魔法方法-(magic-methods)\">五、魔法方法 (Magic Methods)<a title=\"#五、魔法方法-(magic-methods)\" href=\"#五、魔法方法-(magic-methods)\"></a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"1.-__str__-vs-__repr__\">1. <code>__str__</code> vs <code>__repr__</code><a title=\"#1.-__str__-vs-__repr__\" href=\"#1.-__str__-vs-__repr__\"></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><code>__str__</code>: 面向用户，<code>print()</code> 时调用，追求可读性。</li>\n<li><code>__repr__</code>: 面向开发者，交互式命令行时调用，追求准确性（通常格式为 <code>类名(...)</code>，目的是可以通过该字符串重建对象）。</li>\n</ul>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"title class_\">Student</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">__init__</span>(<span class=\"params\">self, name, age</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"variable language_\">self</span>.name = name</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"variable language_\">self</span>.age = age</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">__str__</span>(<span class=\"params\">self</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"string\">f&quot;学生：<span class=\"subst\">&#123;self.name&#125;</span>, <span class=\"subst\">&#123;self.age&#125;</span>岁&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">__repr__</span>(<span class=\"params\">self</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"string\">f&quot;Student(name=&#x27;<span class=\"subst\">&#123;self.name&#125;</span>&#x27;, age=<span class=\"subst\">&#123;self.age&#125;</span>)&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">s = Student(<span class=\"string\">&quot;李白&quot;</span>, <span class=\"number\">18</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(s)          <span class=\"comment\"># 调用 __str__: 学生：李白, 18岁</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">repr</span>(s))    <span class=\"comment\"># 调用 __repr__: Student(name=&#x27;李白&#x27;, age=18)</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h3 id=\"2.-其他常用魔法方法\">2. 其他常用魔法方法<a title=\"#2.-其他常用魔法方法\" href=\"#2.-其他常用魔法方法\"></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><code>__call__</code>: 让类的实例像函数一样被调用 (<code>s()</code>)。</li>\n<li><code>__getitem__</code>: 让实例支持索引访问 (<code>s[0]</code>)。</li>\n<li><code>__enter__</code> / <code>__exit__</code>: 支持上下文管理器 (<code>with</code> 语句)。</li>\n</ul>\n","prev":{"title":"Docker教程：Dockerfile","link":"2024/12/14/Docker教程：Dockerfile"},"next":{"title":"数据结构（python）","link":"2024/02/16/数据结构（python）"},"plink":"https://surespace1.github.io/2024/05/10/python语法进阶（一）/","toc":[{"id":"一、装饰器-(decorators)","title":"一、装饰器 (Decorators)","index":"1","children":[{"id":"1.-基本概念","title":"1. 基本概念","index":"1.1"},{"id":"2.-必备基础","title":"2. 必备基础","index":"1.2"},{"id":"3.-标准装饰器模板","title":"3. 标准装饰器模板","index":"1.3"},{"id":"4.-带参数的装饰器","title":"4. 带参数的装饰器","index":"1.4"}]},{"id":"二、多线程高级运用-(threading)","title":"二、多线程高级运用 (Threading)","index":"2","children":[{"id":"1.-event-对象-(线程通信)","title":"1. Event 对象 (线程通信)","index":"2.1"},{"id":"2.-threading.local-(线程隔离)","title":"2. Threading.local (线程隔离)","index":"2.2"},{"id":"3.-线程池-(threadpoolexecutor)","title":"3. 线程池 (ThreadPoolExecutor)","index":"2.3"}]},{"id":"三、可迭代对象与迭代器","title":"三、可迭代对象与迭代器","index":"3","children":[{"id":"1.-核心区别","title":"1. 核心区别","index":"3.1"},{"id":"2.-生成器-(generator)","title":"2. 生成器 (Generator)","index":"3.2"}]},{"id":"四、asyncio-协程-(重点更新)","title":"四、Asyncio 协程 (重点更新)","index":"4","children":[{"id":"1.-核心概念","title":"1. 核心概念","index":"4.1"},{"id":"2.-现代写法-(python-3.7+)","title":"2. 现代写法 (Python 3.7+)","index":"4.2"},{"id":"3.-并发神器：asyncio.gather","title":"3. 并发神器：asyncio.gather","index":"4.3"},{"id":"4.-同步-vs-异步-性能对比","title":"4. 同步 vs 异步 性能对比","index":"4.4"}]},{"id":"五、魔法方法-(magic-methods)","title":"五、魔法方法 (Magic Methods)","index":"5","children":[{"id":"1.-__str__-vs-__repr__","title":"1. __str__ vs __repr__","index":"5.1"},{"id":"2.-其他常用魔法方法","title":"2. 其他常用魔法方法","index":"5.2"}]}],"reward":true,"copyright":{"custom":"copyright：自由转载-非商用-禁止演绎-保持署名（CC BY-NC-ND 4.0）"},"reading_time":"1875 words in 13 min"}